  "prefLabel": "Rev 710.01 Availability of Forms",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 710.01 Availability of Forms. All forms may be obtained by:\n\n(a) Accessing the department’s web site at www.revenue.nh.gov;\n\n(b) Calling the department’s forms line at 603-230-5001;\n\n(c) Accessing the GTC website and filing the forms electronically; or\n\n(d) Writing to:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\nTaxpayer Services Division\n\nPO Box 637\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03302-0637.\n\nSource. #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 708.01); ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev700.html"
